    image: "https://i.cbc.ca/ais/1.4020970,1489243352000/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C220%2C1387%2C1034%29%3BResize%3D1104",
    initials: "SG",
    theme: "t-light",
  },
  {
    quote: "We knew we had to find the right experts to guide us through this process because we're new to the space. We're extremely grateful for Field Vision's help building a first-of-its-kind go-to-market strategy that will change college sports forever.",
    name: "John Lee",
    title: "COO, The LinkU & Co-Founder, StreamU",
    image: "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C5603AQGLKSj6SQBs3g/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/profile-displayphoto-shrink_400_400/0/1620490315434?e=1777507200&v=beta&t=N-TXOJMs2-xUm1QwKIMCww5CPiqqmxsl72-IUrlEg_4",
    initials: "JL",
    theme: "t-dark",
  },
  {
    quote: "David is one of the elite integrated marketers that can tap into both culture as well as traditional marketing discipline to drive outsized success in market. He's a team guy first and foremost and can join and lead within almost any category. But when you get him into idea workshops and planning on how to build a sustainable and differentiated moat for your business, he's one of the best I've ever seen. Make sure David is on your side for any competitive war — as you'll win those battles!",
    name: "John Koller",
